## Recurring Timing Sweeps

The two sweeps below are **reusable analysis templates**, not one-off scripts. Expect to re-run (and adapt) them whenever you revisit the timing of these trades:

- **Exit timing for the candidate vol trade** -- when to take the position off (the "Monday Exit-Time Sweep"). Vary `end_time_fn`; reuse for other exit days/times or other candidate strategies by swapping the `start_time_fn`/`end_time_fn`/`target_tte`.
- **Entry timing for the monday-morning trades** -- when to initiate (the "Monday-Morning Entry-Time Sweep"). Vary `TRADE_INITIATION_TIME`; add/remove strategies via the `STRATS` list.

Both lean on the same pattern: reuse the already-loaded backtest functions + the on-disk `opt_store/` (no re-pull), sweep one timing parameter, and summarize total PnL + per-cycle Sharpe. Keep the snippets in sync with the scripts if the underlying functions change. New times are free as long as the relevant dates are already in `opt_store/`; a genuinely new date/cycle just triggers an incremental pull.

